            <title type="html"><![CDATA[Native ACME Support Comes to NGINX]]></title>
            <link href="https://www.phpes.org/blog/1970/01/01/_posts/2025-09-1-native-actime-support-comes-to-nginx.md/"/>
            <updated>2025-09-11T19:31:41+00:00</updated>
            <id>https://www.phpes.org/blog/1970/01/01/_posts/2025-09-1-native-actime-support-comes-to-nginx.md/</id>
            <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Let's Encrypt anunciou o módulo nativo do NGINX para geração de certificados utilizando o protocolo ACME.</p>

<blockquote>
  <p>On August 12, the popular open source web server NGINX announced support for ACME with their official ngx_http_acme module (implemented with memory safe Rust code!).</p>
</blockquote>

<p><a href="https://letsencrypt.org/2025/09/11/native-acme-for-nginx">https://letsencrypt.org/2025/09/11/native-acme-for-nginx</a></p>
